  "notes": "{炊|た}く specifically means to cook rice or grains by boiling.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive verb (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧). Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- ⟦ご{飯|はん}→ご飯：00776_gohan⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{炊|た}く: to cook rice\n- ⟦{炊|た}きたて→炊きたて：15234_takitate⟧: freshly cooked\n- ⟦{炊飯器|すいはんき}→炊飯器：04972_suihanki⟧: rice cooker\n- ⟦{炊|た}き{込|こ}みご{飯|はん}→炊き込みご飯：05883_takikomigohan⟧: mixed rice (cooked with ingredients)\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {炊|た}く: to cook (rice, grains)\n- ⟦{焚|た}く→焚く：02285_taku⟧: to burn, kindle (fire, incense)\n\nCONTRAST WITH OTHER COOKING VERBS:\n- {炊|た}く: for rice/grains\n- ⟦{煮|に}る→煮る：01971_niru⟧: to simmer, stew\n- ⟦{茹|ゆ}でる→茹でる：02324_yuderu⟧: to boil (pasta, vegetables)\n- ⟦{焼|や}く→焼く：01123_yaku⟧: to grill, bake",
